[[File:Jerry (Beta 51.0).png|thumb|Beta 51.0]]
Jerry was originally a Taunt monster with 4/6 for 6G. '''Alpha 2.2''' gave it -1 HP, '''Alpha 2.7''' followed that with -1 ATK and Cost, but '''Beta 5.2''' gave it +1 HP again. This leaves it at 3/6 for 5G.
[[File:Jerry (Beta 53.1).png|thumb|Beta 53.1]]
This stayed all the way until '''Beta 51.0''', where Jerry received an additional effect. This effect makes it take 1 less DMG from the effects and (counter-)attacks of monsters with a cost of 4G or less (so basically limited Armor). '''Beta 53.1''' removed it from the starting cardpool (in exchange for [[Charles]] and [[Fishing Rod]]). '''Beta 54.0''' changed its secondary effect to having +1 ATK when there's a monster in front of it.

